# Accepted Trivy findings (ADR-008, ADD §6.2). A Critical or High finding blocks a release unless it is listed
# here with a reason and a date to look at it again — the same rule as ZAP false positives (ADR-020).
#
# Format: one vulnerability id per line, preceded by a comment:
#   # <reason> — review by YYYY-MM-DD
